{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_042C00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Irazú有多个火山口。毕竟它已经喷发过很多次了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"听说很多火山口积满了雨水，变成了湖。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"火山口湖吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"<R=大锅,CALDERA>？嗯，差不多吧。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=大锅,CALDERA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……对了。到了湖边以后，能不能帮我看看有没有什么奇怪的生物？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"听说世界各地都有巨型生物栖息在湖里的传闻。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"尼斯湖的Nessie、阿根廷的Nahuelito、加拿大的Ogopogo……数都数不完。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这些目击报告，也能佐证恐龙仍然存活的说法。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不过，如果是火山口湖，就不会和河流相连。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"是这样没错……不过像刚果的Mokèlé-mbèmbé，它还能在陆地上行走。说不定是迁徙过来后住下的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":128,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"你对<R=未确认动物,UMA>很了解嘛。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=未确认动物,UMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"<R=FSLN,FRENTE>里以前有个当过<R=猎人,HUNTER>的人。他教了我很多东西。听说他还去过怪物岛。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,FRENTE>\", \"<R=猎人,HUNTER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"怪物岛的<R=猎人,HUNTER>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=猎人,HUNTER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"总有一天，我也想成为<R=猎人,HUNTER>，去捕捉珍稀生物。当然，得先让尼加拉瓜重获和平。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=猎人,HUNTER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}